== Notes ==
* {{Dlc|r}} Steven is much less common than his counterpart, spawning only 1/4th as often.
* Steven's arena will always look the same as {{e|Gemini}}'s.
* If already in possession of {{i|Steven}} or {{i|Little Steven}}, the other item will be dropped. If Isaac has both, a normal boss room reward is generated.

